    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is this game?</strong><br><br>The game is an active idler! You mine ore by shooting, and you process the ore to earn upgrades for your mine and factory by purchasing more mining, factory, and defense robots, which allows you to earn even more ore!<br><br>Movement is unique in that you shoot to move, shoot to mine, shoot to upgrade, shoot to fight! You can also control yourself on the ground and in the air using left and right.<br><br>The game is a cozy, lofi music active idler to relax with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How is this an active Idler?</strong><br><br>Waves of monsters spawn to take down your factory. Monsters hate the sound of industry, and you have to defend your factory to keep it running. You could get enough bots to have the waves get shredded by your automations, but gun is always the best defense! Pew-Pew!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is the goal?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numbers go up, factory goes brrrrr!!! Many money, fight bosses, chill, and numbers go up!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is this game?</strong><br><br>The game is an active idler! You mine ore by shooting, and you process the ore to earn upgrades for your mine and factory by purchasing more mining, factory, and defense robots, which allows you to earn even more ore!<br><br>Movement is unique in that you shoot to move, shoot to mine, shoot to upgrade, shoot to fight! You can also control yourself on the ground and in the air using left and right.<br><br>The game is a cozy, lofi music active idler to relax with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How is this an active Idler?</strong><br><br>Waves of monsters spawn to take down your factory. Monsters hate the sound of industry, and you have to defend your factory to keep it running. You could get enough bots to have the waves get shredded by your automations, but gun is always the best defense! Pew-Pew!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is the goal?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numbers go up, factory goes brrrrr!!! Many money, fight bosses, chill, and numbers go up!</p>",
    "short_description": "In GunOre, your gun is your ultimate tool - use it for movement, collecting resources, purchasing upgrades, robots, and defending your mine! Automate your operations and build your defenses as you master the art of movement. Have a cozy time in this active idler mining ore and fighting monsters!",
